        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "subheading": "",
        "description": "<p>Developed with Seatopia <a href=\"/products/king-salmon\">King Salmon</a> &mdash; 8.5&nbsp;oz skin-on Ōra King portions that air fry in 8&ndash;10 minutes from a fridge thaw. Alpine King and Atlantic work under the same method with slightly shorter timing.</p>",
