    "rich_text_standard": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_standard": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Salmon clean enough to eat after every session",
            "heading_size": "title-sm",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_standard": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every Seatopia harvest ships with a Certificate of Analysis. The Ōra King in this recipe is third-party lab tested &mdash; mercury at or below <strong>0.1&nbsp;ppm</strong>, which is ten times stricter than the FDA&rsquo;s 1.0&nbsp;ppm action level, with zero detectable microplastics in the samples analyzed. Each 8.5&nbsp;oz portion carries roughly <strong>3,430&nbsp;mg</strong> of EPA+DHA and <strong>64&nbsp;mcg</strong> of selenium. That is the <a href=\"/pages/seatopia-testing-commitment\">Seatopia Standard</a>, and it is why eating this three times a week is a reasonable thing to do.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
      },
